PARSFILE
#FullDataName Events`CCRb A2. Wait for ACC to Intervene`Euro NCAP ACC Testing
#CheckBox1 1    
*CLEAR
#CheckBox6 0    
#CheckBox7 0    
#CheckBox9 0    
#CheckBox10 0    

#RingCtrl0 <
#RingCtrl10 1
#RingCtrl11 4
RESET_EVENTS
*NAME1 minACC_Gain
*VALUE1 1
#BlueLink10 ` , Miscellaneous` , Miscellaneous` , Miscellaneous`

MAKE_EVENT minACC_Gain < 1 ; Events\Events_6cfeaaba-1cae-4106-a69a-105668dcff90.par
#BlueLink0 Events`CCRb B. Monitor Speed ACC` Euro NCAP ACC Testing` , Events`Events_6cfeaaba-1cae-4106-a69a-105668dcff90

